  "description": "Hye-Jin became a hikikomori after being brutally dumped by her first love. Now that she’s 26, she wants to finally break free from a “life that’s falling behind everyone else’s”! Dreaming of a normal everyday life, she started a part-time job at a gym. But it turns out there was a “helper” waiting for her as she took her first step toward this challenge? Four men gather around the confused Hye-Jin. A full set of romantic entanglements with these four men as grueling as her workouts is about to begin…?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
